  "description": "Han Gyeol and Ho-Young are childhood friends who share a secret crush, but they're both unaware of it. Wanting to end his crush, Gyeol uses a talisman to connect with Ho-Young, but the talisman, which promises to grant love, keeps getting them into strange situations. Not only is Gyeol trapped in a closet alone with Ho-Young, but their \"places\" touch on the subway and he even gets an erection...\n\n *\"Ho, Ho-Young. This isn't-\"\n\n\"Hey, Han Gyeol, you... are you really that big?\"*\n\nA bumbling romantic comedy where the two, oblivious to each other's presence, have bodies overtake their minds!\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
